  "body": "Discover a home where thoughtful design, natural light and beautiful surroundings come together. 14 Moko Road offers a stylish and comfortable sanctuary, designed for easy everyday living with a lovely elevated outlook.\r\n\r\nThe elevated position creates a wonderful sense of openness, while the thoughtfully designed layout delivers excellent indoor-outdoor flow. Two of the three bedrooms also enjoy direct access to the outdoor area, adding flexibility and a strong connection to the outdoors.\r\n\r\nInside, the home is sun-filled and welcoming, with large front-facing windows drawing in plenty of natural light throughout the living spaces. The open-plan kitchen, dining and living area provides a generous sense of space and forms the heart of the home.\r\n\r\nStep outside to the rear deck and enjoy the pleasant elevated outlook. It is a comfortable spot to enjoy your morning coffee, unwind in the afternoon sun or take in the changing scenery as the day fades. At dusk, the view takes on a different character, with the sparkling lights of Orewa stretching across the horizon.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n• Sun-filled open-plan living: Generous kitchen, dining and living spaces create a bright and inviting heart of the home.\r\n• Large front-facing windows: Designed to maximise natural light and enhance the sense of space.\r\n• Elevated outlook: Enjoy good district views and a lovely evening outlook towards the sparkling lights of Orewa.\r\n• Three generous bedrooms & two bathrooms: The master suite features a private ensuite and built-in storage.\r\n• Designer kitchen: Quality fittings, a walk-in pantry and spacious breakfast island make the kitchen both stylish and practical.\r\n• Excellent indoor-outdoor flow: The living areas connect naturally with the outdoor space, while two bedrooms also open directly outside.\r\n\r\nSpa-inspired bathrooms: The main bathroom features a deep freestanding bathtub for a touch of everyday luxury.\r\nConvenient location: Just minutes from Orewa Beach, local cafés, Nukumea School and motorway access.\r\n\r\nCome home to sunshine, space and an elevated outlook. 14 Moko Road offers a relaxed coastal lifestyle with the comfort and convenience of a thoughtfully designed modern home.",
